sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MutWH as ODH Mutating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ValWH as ODH Validating Webhook<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant NbCtrl as notebook-controller<br/>(upstream)
    participant ODHCtrl as odh-notebook-controller<br/>(ODH/RHOAI)
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant NbPod as Notebook Pod<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant Culler as CullingReconciler

    Note over User,NbPod: Flow 1: Notebook Creation

    User->>K8sAPI: POST Notebook CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>MutWH: Admission Review (CREATE)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission
    MutWH->>K8sAPI: GET ImageStream tags<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>MutWH: Image digest
    MutWH-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Notebook<br/>(+kube-rbac-proxy sidecar, proxy env, CA bundles)
    K8sAPI->>ValWH: Admission Review (CREATE)<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission
    ValWH-->>K8sAPI: Allowed (security validated)
    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook created

    K8sAPI->>NbCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    NbCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet + Service<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    K8sAPI->>ODHCtrl: Watch event: Notebook created<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    ODHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute, ReferenceGrant,<br/>NetworkPolicy, kube-rbac-proxy resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over User,NbPod: Flow 2: Notebook Access

    User->>Gateway: GET notebook UI<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>KRBP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (forwarded)
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Auth result
    KRBP->>NbPod: Proxy to notebook<br/>HTTP/8888, No encryption<br/>Auth: None (localhost)
    NbPod-->>KRBP: Notebook response
    KRBP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Notebook UI

    Note over Culler,NbPod: Flow 3: Idle Culling

    Culler->>NbPod: Probe kernel activity<br/>HTTP/8888, No encryption
    NbPod-->>Culler: Kernel status
    Culler->>K8sAPI: Patch Notebook (stop annotation)<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    NbCtrl->>K8sAPI: Scale StatefulSet to 0<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
